Collaboration between departments is essential for the success of our IT initiatives. The IT division regularly meets with the Sales, HR, and Finance departments to align technology solutions with business objectives. Monthly inter-departmental meetings facilitated by the CTO, David Kim, help identify emerging needs and opportunities for cross-functional projects.

